g\",\n  \"precision\": \"bf16 autocast; TF32 disabled; no torch.compile\",\n  \"history_policy\": \"official_offline\",\n  \"history_visibility\": \"Exact released prefix/action inputs. Delayed feedback may not be mature at prediction time; results only establish this offline benchmark.\",\n  \"drop_last\": {\n    \"train\": true,\n    \"valid\": false\n  },\n  \"full_validation_samples\": 2871767,\n  \"training\": \"scratch; official single-pass recipe adapted to DIN; sum four BCE unless declared training-loss hook\",\n  \"baseline\": \"Initial empirical reference: DIN local activation over item-field history with action values and four separate heads; field/task adaptation, not exact original DIN reproduction\",\n  \"research_goal\": \"Explore and validate mechanism-distinct unified modeling of multi-field user/context/target features and multi-feedback behavior histories. Develop representations and information flow that jointly support sequence modeling, feature interaction and task prediction under the fixed data and compute protocol.\",\n  \"architecture_search\": {\n    \"scope\": \"Whole-model design, including replacement of the initial network and all internal representations.\",\n    \"design_dimensions\": [\n      \"Representation units: fields, events, behavior groups, learned slots and target/task tokens.\",\n      \"Information flow: stacked interaction, layer-wise joint interaction, parallel exchange, learned routing or other testable unified structures.\",\n      \"History selection/compression jointly designed with target/context-conditioned retrieval.\",\n      \"Derived features computed from authorized inputs: field matches, behavior counts/composition, grouping and sequence positions.\",\n      \"Shared and task-conditioned representations, prediction readouts and registered training-loss mechanisms.\"\n    ],\n    \"lineage\": \"parent_trial identifies a comparison and evidence lineage; it does not require code or architectural inheritance. in